#: ../../zh/triton_api/Compiler_Hint_Ops/max_contiguous.md:21
msgid ""
"**`values`描述着每个维度的连续性特征，所以`values` 的维度要与`input` 的维度相同。 "
"注意当`shape`的最后一维为`1`时出现的降维情况。**"
msgstr ""
"**`values` describes the contiguity characteristics of each dimension, so "
"the dimension of `values` must match the dimension of `input`. Note the "
"dimensionality reduction when the last dimension of `shape` is `1`.**"

#: ../../zh/triton_api/Compiler_Hint_Ops/max_contiguous.md:24
msgid "如：二维 `input`对应通用`values`入参为`[1,1]`。"
msgstr ""
"For example: a 2D `input` corresponds to the general `values` parameter "
"`[1,1]`."

